      "description": "Original Extrude SVG with the native icon-only command states; action naming stays accessible.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-icon-command\" aria-label=\"Extrude\" title=\"Extrude\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\r\n<g stroke=\"#51575d\" stroke-width=\"0.95\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 10.5 L12 7 19 10.5 12 14 Z\" fill=\"#dedfe1\" /><path d=\"M5 10.5 L12 14 12 21 5 17.5 Z\" fill=\"#b8bdc2\" /><path d=\"M12 14 L19 10.5 19 17.5 12 21 Z\" fill=\"#899198\" /><path d=\"M9 8 V4 H15 V8\" fill=\"#dedfe1\" /><path d=\"M12 6 V1 M9 4 L12 1 15 4\" fill=\"none\" /></g>\r\n</svg></button>",
